<Layout title="Architecture Technology Resources | ATECT Architecture" description="Technology resources for architectural design, visualization, field documentation, project organization, and the built environment.">
  <section class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Resources / Technology</p><h1>Technology for the Built Environment</h1><p>Technology can make design communication, documentation, visualization, field work, and project organization more efficient when it serves the workflow rather than distracting from it.</p></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Digital Workflows</p><h2>Use technology where it improves clarity.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">ATECT's technology resources will focus on practical applications for architects, builders, contractors, homeowners, and design professionals.</p></div>
    <div class="resource-list">
      <a href="/3d-renderings"><strong>3D Visualization</strong><span>See how renderings can help communicate design intent before construction.</span></a>
      <a href="/resources/design-tools"><strong>Design & Documentation Tools</strong><span>Explore the role of digital tools in architectural planning and construction documentation.</span></a>
      <a href="/resources"><strong>ATECT Architecture Resources</strong><span>Return to the complete ATECT resource library as partner recommendations are added.</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section alt"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Coming Next</p><h2>Partner recommendations will be added selectively.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">When products and services are included, ATECT will identify relevant recommendations and disclose affiliate relationships where applicable.</p></div><a class="button dark" href="/resources">Explore the Resource Library</a></section>
</Layout>
<style>
.resource-list{display:grid;gap:12px}.resource-list a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px;padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.resource-list strong{font:600 23px/1.25 Manrope}.resource-list span{color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:700px){.resource-list a{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}}
</style>